---
source: crates/editor-aqua/tests/scenario/states.rs
expression: "editor.settle(\"the failure to show\", |view|\n{ view.shows(\"Couldn't\") && view.find(Role::Button, \"Try again\").is_some() })"
---
Button "Hide sidebar"
  Label "A"
  Label "R"
  Label "T"
  Label "I"
  Label "S"
  Label "A"
  Label "N"
